%description:
scenario was a parameter of the channel model: one scenario for every cell on a carrier. A link is
now evaluated in the deployment of its base station, which the base station node states. An
ini file that still sets the channel model's parameter would be ignored without a message, and
the simulation would silently run in the default deployment. Setting it is an error at
initialization.

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
network = simu5g.test.moduletest.lib.NrSessionTestNetwork

**.nrChannelModel[*].scenario = "URBAN_MICROCELL"

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%exitcode: 1
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stderr
The 'scenario' parameter is no longer the channel model's: a link is evaluated in the deployment of its base station
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
